--
--              Approach
--              =========
--              1.  Start with `repository_dependencies` (`rd`) because that
--                  table captures manifest entries.
--              2.  Filter rows whose `dependency_project_name` LOWER‑cases to
--                  one of the real library IDs we observed.
--              3.  Join to `repositories` (`r`) on **text keys**
--                 (`name_with_owner`, `host_type`) to avoid missing rows
--                 when `repository_id` is NULL or stale.
--              4.  LEFT JOIN to `projects` (`p`) via `dependency_project_id`
--                 so we can show canonical library information where present.
--              5.  Convert repository size from kilobytes to bytes,
--                 de‑duplicate with DISTINCT, and LIMIT 20 for a readable
