--                  join ensures we still bring in repository rows even when
--                  host_type differs or the repository entry is partially
--                  missing (the earlier exact‑key joins yielded zero rows).
--              3.  Use COALESCE so that repos without a detected language
--                  are bucketed under the label 'Unknown'.
--              4.  Aggregate distinct repositories per language and sort by
--                  descending count.  LIMIT 20 gives the most frequent
--                  languages for inspection.
