Column name: id Type: INT64 Description: The unique primary key of the tag in the Libraries.io database.
Column name: host_type Type: STRING Description: Which website the tags repository is hosted on, either GitHub, GitLab or Bitbucket.
Column name: repository_name_with_owner Type: STRING Description: The repository name and owner seperated by a slash, also maps to the url slug on the given repository host e.g. librariesio/libraries.io.
Column name: repository_id Type: INT64 Description: The unique primary key of the repository for this tag in the Libraries.io database.
Column name: tag_name Type: STRING Description: The name of the tag often is a version number but could be any freeform string.
Column name: tag_git_sha Type: STRING Description: Sha of the object that the tag is pointing at in the repository.
Column name: tag_published_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: The timestamp of when the tag was published.
Column name: tag_created_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: The timestamp of when the tag was first saved by Libraries.io.
Column name: tag_updated_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: The timestamp of when the tag was last saved by Libraries.io.
